  "theologicalNotes": "Westminster Standards. Associate Reformed Presbyterian. Covenant theology. Infant baptism. Amillennial. Pastor Andrew Shoger. Address: 2297 Coddle Creek Hwy, Mooresville, NC 28115-8739. Website: http://www.coddlecreekarp.org/.",
  "description": "Coddle Creek ARP Church is a congregation of the Associate Reformed Presbyterian Church located in the Mooresville area of Iredell County, North Carolina. The ARP denomination was formed in 1782 through the union of Associate and Reformed Presbyterian bodies of Scottish heritage that had settled in colonial America. The congregation subscribes to the Westminster Confession of Faith and the Larger and Shorter Catechisms as faithful summaries of biblical doctrine. It holds to covenant theology, the baptism of believers and their children, and an amillennial reading of Scripture. Worship centers on the exposition of the inerrant Word and the right administration of the sacraments under presbyterian polity within ARP Synod.",
